    "name": "Sonatype Lifecycle Public REST Scan Health Configuration API",
    "description": "Use this REST API to manage Scan Health configuration. This includes settings for\nfailing scans with zero components detected. Configurations can be set at organization\nor application level and are inherited from the organization hierarchy.",
